Claude Design skill for openclaude
==================================

This bundled skill ships content adapted from two upstream sources:

1. The Claude Design master system prompt — released by Anthropic Labs
   on 2026-04-17 with the Claude Design product (claude.ai/design).
   Adapted to remove proprietary tool references and rewire the
   workflow onto openclaude's native tools.

2. Open Design (https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design) — an Apache-2.0
   open-source replica of Claude Design. We vendor:

   - The skills/<name>/SKILL.md prompt bodies as references/skills/*.md
     (113 named workflows: web-prototype, wireframe-sketch, tweaks,
     html-ppt, simple-deck, dashboard, saas-landing, mobile-app,
     pricing-page, pm-spec, weekly-update, sprite-animation,
     video-shortform, hyperframes, dating-web, gamified-app, and many
     more).

   - The craft/*.md design-discipline guidelines as references/craft/*.md
     (12 docs: anti-ai-slop, accessibility-baseline, animation-discipline,
     color, form-validation, laws-of-ux, rtl-and-bidi, state-coverage,
     typography-hierarchy, typography-hierarchy-editorial, typography).

   - A representative subset of design-systems/<name>/DESIGN.md files
     as references/design-systems/*.md (~15 brand systems).

   - The skills/html-ppt/assets/themes/*.css theme overrides and
     skills/html-ppt/templates/single-page/*.html slide templates and
     skills/html-ppt/references/*.md authoring docs as
     references/html-ppt/themes|templates|refs/*.

License: Apache 2.0 (Open Design); the Claude Design master prompt is
adapted under fair use for interoperability and is rewritten to refer
to openclaude's native tools.

Vendor source: https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design
